### Get a single publication in XML format

GET https://mig-smhi.pre.diva-portal.org/rest/record/diva-output/2159
Accept: application/vnd.cora.record+xml


### Get a single publication in JSON format

GET https://mig-smhi.pre.diva-portal.org/rest/record/diva-output/2159
Accept: application/vnd.cora.record+json


### Get a binary record (file wrapper)

GET https://mig-smhi.pre.diva-portal.org/rest/record/binary/binary:10533026229849381
Accept: application/vnd.cora.record+xml


